<title>SINGAPORE: Tuan Sing unit to list in Singapore SESDAQ.</title>
<headline>Tuan Sing unit to list in Singapore SESDAQ.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified group Tuan Sing Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its subsidiary, Gul Technologies Singapore Pte Ltd, had received approval to list on the Stock Exchange of Singapore's second board, SESDAQ.</p>
<p>Tuan Sing has an 80-percent stake in Gul Technologies, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Gul Technologies manufactures a wide range of printed circuit boards and sells its products to customers in the computer, automotive, telecommunication and medical industries.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
